.TH LERPF 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
lerpf \- Linear interpolation of floats: a when t = 0, b when t = 1
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqmathx.h\(dq
.BI "float lerpf(float a, float b, float t);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Linear interpolation of floats: a when t = 0, b when t = 1. Health bar animation, volume ramps, anything that slides between two numbers.
.PP
This is a static inline function; it is defined in the header.
.SH RETURN VALUE
a + (b \- a) * t.
.SH MODULE
math (src/engine/math/mathx.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR v2_lerp (3),
.BR smooth_t (3),
.BR clampf (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
